{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_016_01_j",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:74546ea469cc6d78e0a11f0876ba93efed024cb0714c12b98a9e30c0c4c7d4bd",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_j:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de00942ab69a4a13a1f69b35ed29a56acfba8dade6c9803957377d25e91142b2",
      "text": "关于之前听说的发掘“著名学生会长”中\n另外两位的这件事……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_j:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a282aa2a5d592c78510d7e15ad25369291a065d4d3286b476061a550c8dea0e",
      "text": "由我们直接闯进学校里去什么的，\n果然还是挺难办的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_j:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0767ac72a340ee20b81e68c9e8a49243e9280cb36d049de87ec910756d567d59",
      "text": "是啊。就像见秀先生的时候那样，\n在学校以外的地方相遇是最理想的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_j:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf25d8d59e68e1a3ec3495c109abf2e31c6e6a29845141d73d6a79aa4367663e",
      "text": "但是，在学校以外什么的，\n那种事只能指望偶然了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_j:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bd9e7e11f8aca346704844211a2c97d33d90c50de3bb2c0c887ec5d18980405",
      "text": "没有那回事！秀先生除了我之外，\n不是还有很多可以依靠的伙伴吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_j:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d15db60a08152adb96309b4aa10540fe5e0916bd3738b644edaf12b774adf57f",
      "text": "手机……？\n对啊，在社交平台上，借助我的粉丝们的力量的话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_j:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:887b4bed946a370b543ab683c6acdf3f0343d2473f3abfc683d88abdb72348f1",
      "text": "（像这样依靠别人还是头一次。\n但是……现在可不是顾虑帅不帅气的时候）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_j:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca53d7a127f7275df57360bf62257fe57c272fd17b934b9c5acec86fe33727a1",
      "text": "（你可是个天才吧，天峰秀。\n既然这样，就用行动证明出来啊！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_j:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b34e20992db630785d57234f9ba5ce45e67ea21cbad3806dcd9c4699f0b0ca8f",
      "text": "明白了。我向大家呼吁一下试试。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_j:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ae21aa57e8f9906295ba9fdd6f73b4bdfceba7fca8ffd55ebf36ddac78a14f2",
      "text": "……来了！\n两个人好像都在涩谷！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_j:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc28b8b5f1f4d09e458a16d2bb76d0678fd53ee8607e935a7210fd2b66dd2f37",
      "text": "好多人都说看到了锐心学长和百百人学长。\n现在去的话应该能遇上吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_j:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebba2d17afaff877eff96135ae3b25cbceb1e1d9abdadc7f4c3af0db793b34b8",
      "text": "我们现在立刻赶过去吧。秀先生和粉丝们\n给予的这次机会，绝对不能错过！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_j:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2ccffb128dccc202de969b4e7bfc4d73fbc724983d87473b76e0143e8dac03a",
      "text": "就得这样嘛。\n见到他们俩之后，就由我们来发掘！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
